WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:01,240
Don't worry

2
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:04,260
Have you forgotten that Miss Liang won't let us do anything to women?

3
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,860
You are not afraid of the gun in her hand anymore

4
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:09,150
Are we just going to watch this?

5
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:10,750
I told you not to rush

6
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:14,010
Listen to me. Wait for the signal and you will hear it.

7
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:26,090
But now I am not afraid of Sister Zhihan at all

8
00:00:26,290 --> 00:00:27,490
what are you talking about

9
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:29,570
Can we go out?

10
00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:30,970
Jingjing, why are you here?

11
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:32,370
There are plenty of supplies here

12
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:33,970
I suggest you don't go out

13
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:35,370
Just stay here and wait for rescue

14
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:36,770
I'm discussing with this gentleman

15
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:38,970
I want to borrow his car to pick up people who are trapped nearby.

16
00:00:38,970 --> 00:00:40,570
There are enough people here

17
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:42,370
Why are you bringing someone else over?

18
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:45,810
That car of yours is so handsome

19
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:47,010
where did you get it

20
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:48,410
How many people can fit inside?

21
00:00:49,070 --> 00:00:50,070
I'm a car repairman

22
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:53,070
I modified it out of boredom when I was stuck in front of the garage.
